1eb185e55","body":[{"type":"text","value":"9. 如图所示，是 4 种传感器，图 1 是“液位监测仪”用来监测液面高度的变化，图 2 是某电子秤的电路图，图 3 是霍尔元件的示意图，图 4 是安装在汽车上的加速度计，它们的基本工作原理是把非电学量转换为电学量，从而方便进行测量、传输和控制。下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/39b7f0baed63c3afe027c67e274a5a87ce3e5a280e5e3b9de341725e3952ded5.png","width":135,"height":189,"width_mm":15.875,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q09-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/87aa659e4f50cd8e5720957b81dcd1178901f2f77036c58d17d67ed369ea2d1b.png","width":222,"height":231,"width_mm":26.106,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q09-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图2\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3b5a0d7d62522ef10e5b5651b777ed7743d17b5bba2c1a6c583a93deb297d258.png","width":216,"height":231,"width_mm":25.4,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q09-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图3\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/06fb9e6410c11ff8e75f8494c3a4f8789386535d1d3678c3d258bbe22897d535.png","width":273,"height":237,"width_mm":32.103,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q09-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图4\n第9题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 由图1可知，当数字电容表示数减小时，可知液面高度上升了"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 由图2可知，称重物时，在重物重力作用下使滑片 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 下移，则电路中电流增大，所以电路中电流 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":" 与重物的重量 "},{"type":"math","value":"G"},{"type":"text","value":" 成正比"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 由图3可知，磁场沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向，若自由移动的电荷是电子，则 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{MN}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为负值"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 由图4可知，输出信号电压 "},{"type":"math","value":"U"},{"type":"text","value":" 与装置的加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 成正比"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q10","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q10","number":"10","order":10,"type":"单选题","topics":["近代物理","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"96009b33cb36201fd42e02eb86e755e5eacb49038eb5a32240937a715797b143","body":[{"type":"text","value":"10. 按照经典电磁学理论,绕核做圆周运动的电子,其加速会导致电磁波辐射而逐渐失去动能,最终坠入原子核,从而导致所谓的“原子坍缩”。为了解决经典物理学的这种困境,玻尔提出了定态概念,认为氢原子中电子的运动轨道是稳定的,不向外辐射电磁波,但在这些轨道运动的电子能量是量子化的。根据物质波假设,若将氢原子中量子数为 n 的定态视为如图所示的稳态波形,则结合经典物理的规律,可能得到与玻尔理论相同的结论。已知带电量为 q 的点电荷在距离为 r 处的电势 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\phi = \\frac{kq}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,其中 k 为静电力常量。电子质量为 m,普朗克常量为 h,则量子数为 n、半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r_{n}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的定态轨道电子的\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/2231cbca196994e4fb2f27be59ebaadb4efbd9ca1c41de5ed050986972ca2ffd.png","width":367,"height":343,"width_mm":43.061,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q10-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第10题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 波长 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda_{n}=\\frac{4\\pi r_{n}}{n}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{n}=2\\pi\\frac{nh}{r_{n}m}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 电势能 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_{n}=-\\frac{1}{m}\\left(\\frac{nh}{2\\pi r_{n}}\\right)^{2}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 能量 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{n}=\\frac{1}{2m}\\left(\\frac{nh}{2\\pi r_{n}}\\right)^{2}"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q11","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q11","number":"11","order":11,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学","热学","电学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"7ca53e33f4babea7fc22fa2423b88190860c53146d9663788a387585bcfa5556","body":[{"type":"text","value":"11. 下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/be08f44951441ea68834acb145e9623cd471666782b773986951ea4845df7a93.png","width":235,"height":136,"width_mm":27.419,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q11-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/449dd36c07e791955af8f430105d5d5dfdc654e2b926c8386f26d33613e409d6.png","width":184,"height":180,"width_mm":21.531,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q11-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/190f8ca086924d2d39e2b33ded56a65c4b55c569ee6cab480661f92926ec286b.png","width":204,"height":180,"width_mm":23.923,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q11-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/47041c093f1640aa8462e96f6b5da2a2212ba4af3ac98138c5d7321200d47ade.png","width":510,"height":127,"width_mm":59.807,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q11-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丁\n第11题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 图甲是方解石晶体的双折射现象，说明方解石晶体沿不同方向的光学性质不同"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 图乙是显微镜下观察水中悬浮的细颗粒在每隔一定时间的位置的连线，则说明在短时间内细颗粒的运动是规则的"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 图丙的图示时刻，电容器两极板间的电场强度正在增大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 图丁的X射线是原子核能级跃迁时发射的波长很短的电磁波"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AC","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q12","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q12","number":"12","order":12,"type":"多选题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"ba0a65e645adb54d0673833b761d0b5ed06cdd583f6792fd4eaed3e21ed18e8a","body":[{"type":"text","value":"12. 如图所示，两根足够长的导轨由上下段电阻不计、光滑的金属导轨组成，在 M 、N 两点绝缘连接，M 、N 等高，间距 L=1 m，连接处平滑。导轨平面与水平面夹角为30°，导轨两端分别连接一个阻值R=0.02 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"的电阻和C=1F的电容器，整个装置处于B=0.2 T的垂直导轨平面斜向上的匀强磁场中，两根导体棒ab、cd分别放在MN两侧，质量分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}=0.8\\ kg"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"m_{2}=0.4kg"},{"type":"text","value":" ，ab棒电阻为0.08 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"，cd棒的电阻不计，将ab由静止释放，同时cd从距离MN为 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{0}=4.32\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" 处在一个大小F=4.64 N，方向沿导轨平面向上的力作用下由静止开始运动，两棒恰好在M、N处发生完全非弹性碰撞，碰撞前瞬间撤去F，已知碰前瞬间ab的速度为4.5 m/s， "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10\\ m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8c4dfd10c15d1c6af40f64da81fcc9127d11213bd8ae951267cfc6e79dcfc7c1.png","width":453,"height":282,"width_mm":53.269,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 12 题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. ab 从释放到碰撞前所用时间为 1.44 s"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. ab 棒从释放到碰前运动的距离为 4m"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. ab 从释放到碰撞前，R 上消耗的焦耳热为 0.78 J"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 两棒碰撞后瞬间的速度大小为 0.6m/s"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"CD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q13","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"75608014f3e958edc7e93165cd7a5eceaed9e7bcd3cd7430a407ee24baf028d7","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 如图所示，玻璃棱镜 ABC 的截面是底角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"45^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的等腰直角三角形，与底边 BC 平行复色光从 AB 边上的 D 点射入棱镜后分解为两束 a、b，经 BC 边反射后从 AC 边射出（图中未画出）。已知棱镜对 a、b 两束光的折射率满足 "},{"type":"math","value":"n_{a} > n_{b} = 1.5"},{"type":"text","value":" ，下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f65303a42217cddb2e0f785b0924ea0d2985e02ff4226ead6e760585504c4588.png","width":442,"height":264,"width_mm":51.894,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q13-row1"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 两束光从 "},{"type":"math","value":"AC"},{"type":"text","value":" 边同一位置平行于 "},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":" 边射出"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 光从 "},{"type":"math","value":"AC"},{"type":"text","value":" 边射出位置一定离底边更近"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 复色光在纸平面绕 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 点顺时针转动 "},{"type":"math","value":"45^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的过程中， "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 光在棱镜中的传播时间始终大于 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 光"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 复色光在纸平面绕 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 点顺时针转动 "},{"type":"math","value":"45^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的过程中，从 "},{"type":"math","value":"AC"},{"type":"text","value":" 边射出时 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 两束光相互平行，但与 "},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":" 边不平行"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BCD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q14","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6d026f3ab86002ead1307231808659981ac4c073043fb37cf8c85b2032881c41","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题（I、II两题共14分）\n14-I.（6分）\n（1）①用如图1所示的装置探究小车的加速度与力的关系。将轨道分上下双层排列，两小车尾部的刹车线由后面的刹车系统同时控制（未画出），能使两小车同时起动、同时停下。通过改变槽码盘中的槽码来改变拉力的大小。实验中，两小车的质量（填空）(填“必须相等”或“可以不等”); （填空）（填“需要”或“不要”）调整轨道的倾角以平衡摩擦力。为了测量甲、乙两小车的加速度之比，还需要下列器材是（填空）\nA. 打点计时器\nB. 秒表\nC. 刻度尺\nD. 弹簧秤\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a020fcb56717917a5467006da27420a7ec33565772d5a38e79b99dde0b64f8ad.png","width":356,"height":211,"width_mm":41.773,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-I题图1\n（2）用如图 2 所示的装置“探究弹簧弹力与形变量的关系”。某同学测量出弹簧自由地处于水平状态时的长度作为原长，则他用图 2 甲装置进行测量，作出的弹力 F 与伸长量 x 的图像是图 2 乙中的图线 （填空）（“1”、“2”或“3”）；理由是 （填空）；这条图线的斜率 （填空）（“等于”、“小于”、“大于”）被测弹簧的劲度系数。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cb27a20a72af77dfa4c2396c3db1bb18a123b1d83daeba601653c50eb51611d9.png","width":201,"height":309,"width_mm":23.636,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图2甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/932b5123ad6c56dddc86610982f9da1731a1bca79111421c0c2c5c08bd234619.png","width":246,"height":201,"width_mm":28.928,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图2乙\n第 14-I 题图\n14-II.（8分）在做“测量电池电动势和内阻”实验中\n（1）某同学用图 1 所示的电路，在某次测量中，电压表示数如图 2 所示，则读数为 （填空）V；然后调节电阻 R，测得多组数据，用图像法求电动势 E 和内阻 r，由于 （填空）（填“电压表”或“电流表”）的读数不是被测量量的真实值，电动势 E 的测量值 （填空）（填“大于”“等于”或“小于”）真实值；内阻 r 的测量值 （填空）（填“大于”“等于”或“小于”）真实值。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/03eb8f258ec4bf5805b8e5939ff2d169ecfbd06e608919de2458ed84f06247b2.png","width":384,"height":234,"width_mm":45.156,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e33825c16522c575c7b7190e2bd53df99cfcace0f6a5f0c6da70bd822896fd3d.png","width":351,"height":285,"width_mm":41.275,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图 2\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e5b41131fb8c0ac6a3e60379d4f2b7dfde0679f861a9e4a75a5de6d6000a182d.png","width":375,"height":270,"width_mm":44.097,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图3\n第14-II题图\n（2）为了消除电表内阻产生的系统误差，该同学重新设计了测量电路如图3所示。其中电源 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 是待测电源， "},{"type":"math","value":"E'"},{"type":"text","value":" 是辅助电源。实验操作如下：  \na. 先闭合 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{S}_1"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{S}_2"},{"type":"text","value":" ，再调节 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"R'"},{"type":"text","value":" ，使得闭合 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{S}_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 时电流表示数不变，读出 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{S}_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 闭合后两表的示数 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_1"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_1"},{"type":"text","value":" ；  \nb. 重复步骤 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" ，调节 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"R'"},{"type":"text","value":" ，使得闭合 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{S}_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 时电流表示数不变（与步骤 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 的值不同），读出 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{S}_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 闭合后两表的示数 "},{"type":"math","value":"I_2"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"U_2"},{"type":"text","value":" ；  \nc. 用测量数据求出 "},{"type":"math","value":"E="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空），"},{"type":"math","value":"r="},{"type":"text","value":"（填空）。"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题（I、II两题共14分）\n14-I.（6分）\n（1）①必须相等（1分）\n需要（1分）\nC（1分）\n（2）3（1分）\n弹簧自重（1分）\n等于（1分）\n14-II.（8分）\n（1）1.40～1.42（1分）\n电流表（1分）\n小于（1分）\n小于（1分）\n（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"E=\\frac{U_2I_1-U_1I_2}{I_1-I_2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac{U_2-U_1}{I_1-I_2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q15","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a01851c87f51d817ffe5fabce393f600d07f425060137f1acd8809d0a1886ce5","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）有人设计了一种测温装置，其结构如图所示。玻璃泡 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 内封有一定质量的气体，与 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 相连的 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 管插在水银槽中，管内外水银面的高度差 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 即可反映泡内气体的温度，即环境温度，并可由 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 管上的刻度直接读出。设 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 管水银槽上面的长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_0 = 30\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 管体积与 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 泡的体积相比可忽略。不考虑 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 管中水银柱长度变化时，对水银槽液面的影响。\n（1）在标准大气压（相当于 "},{"type":"math","value":"76 \\, cm"},{"type":"text","value":" 高的水银柱所产生的压强）下对 B 管进行温度刻度。当温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为 "},{"type":"math","value":"27^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，管内水银面高度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"26 \\, cm"},{"type":"text","value":" ，此高度即为 "},{"type":"math","value":"27^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":" 的刻度线。B 管上温度最低的刻度线对应的温度是多少（℃）？\n（2）求 B 管上温度刻度线 t 与 x 的关系，并说明刻度线是否均匀；\n（3）若温度缓慢升高，气体吸收热量 30J，同时对外做功 20J，求气体内能的变化。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b3ad6be77bb9cacc45ac0f2f33c1e928150355e1b56dec8e74f73c596eb4c104.png","width":270,"height":438,"width_mm":31.75,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 15 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.（8分）\n（1）气体等容变化"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{P_1}{T_1}=\\frac{P_2}{T_2}"},{"type":"text","value":"①"},{"type":"math","value":"T_1=300\\,\\mathrm{K},\\ p_1=76-26=50\\,\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"高水银柱，"},{"type":"math","value":"p_2=76-30=46\\,\\mathrm{cm}"},{"type":"text","value":"高水银柱　②"},{"type":"math","value":"T_2=276\\,\\mathrm{K},\\ t_2=3^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}"},{"type":"text","value":"③\n（2）因"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{P_1}{T_1}=\\frac{p}{T}"},{"type":"text","value":"，④\n即"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{50}{300}=\\frac{76-x}{273+t}\\quad t=183-6x"},{"type":"text","value":"⑤\n可见"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"与"},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":"之间是线性关系，所以刻度线均匀　⑥\n（3）热力学第一定律，有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=Q+W"},{"type":"text","value":"⑦"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=30\\,\\mathrm{J},\\ W=-20\\,\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U=10\\,\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"⑧\n评分标准：①～⑧式各1分，共8分"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q16","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"57abb735f54f7fcdb03cc3bdf7d9609b6e062fda7793f8e9a2f9ddd315c147eb","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. （11分）如图1是冲击电流计的表头内部结构，线框是由 "},{"type":"math","value"