,"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）\n（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"I_C=nlBi\\Delta t=nB_0lq"},{"type":"text","value":"①\n（2）"},{"type":"math","value":"d=2\\varphi r"},{"type":"text","value":"②\n而"},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi=k_2\\omega_0,\\ \\omega_0=k_1I_C"},{"type":"text","value":"，再利用"},{"type":"math","value":"I_C"},{"type":"text","value":"的表达式，可求出"},{"type":"math","value":"k=2nk_1k_2B_0lr"},{"type":"text","value":"③\n（3）①向左　④\n②把P从1、2扳到3、4，通过测试线圈的磁感应强度反向，磁通量变化"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta\\phi=2BS"},{"type":"text","value":"⑤\n通过冲击电流计的电荷量"},{"type":"math","value":"q'=N\\frac{\\Delta\\phi}{\\Delta t}\\frac{1}{R}\\Delta t=N\\frac{\\Delta\\phi}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"⑥\n又"},{"type":"math","value":"d_0=kq'"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"B=\\frac{Rd_0}{2kNS}"},{"type":"text","value":"⑦\n评分标准：①②③⑥式各2分，④⑤⑦各1分，共11分"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q17","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3a78857338b5364ff6a5eef99f5104d82968f7b2bd2d307e0b51b5f81aad8477","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. （12分）如图所示，水平面上固定一光滑圆弧轨道，圆心角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 4.8\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 为圆心， "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 点与地面相切。水平面的 "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间放置一足够长的轻弹簧，右端 "},{"type":"math","value":"D"},{"type":"text","value":" 点固定， "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间粗糙，其余光滑。现将一质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 2\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的小物块P从空中某位置以初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0} = 2\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":" 水平抛出，恰好从圆弧轨道的最高点 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 无碰撞的进入圆弧轨道，从 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 端离开后向右运动压缩弹簧，然后又被弹簧弹回，不计物块与弹簧碰撞损失的能量。已知小物块与水平面 "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = 0.7"},{"type":"text","value":" ，弹簧的劲度系数 "},{"type":"math","value":"k = 100\\mathrm{N / m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，弹簧的弹性势能 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{P} = \\frac{1}{2} kx^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" （ "},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":" 为弹簧的劲度系数， "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 为弹簧的形变量）， "},{"type":"math","value":"g = 10\\mathrm{m / s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n求:\n（1）小物块抛出点的高度 h;\n(2) 弹簧的最大压缩量 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）小物块在相邻两次压缩弹簧，其压缩量的减小值 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta x"},{"type":"text","value":" ，以及最终小物块静止的位置距离C点的距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8c49342c835841411856a3aa0f3dcd4eff3555f2c8f61b3ada2a79a28cc85ddc.png","width":611,"height":211,"width_mm":71.769,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）\n（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan\\theta=\\frac{v_{yA}}{v_{xA}}"},{"type":"text","value":"①"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{yA}=2\\sqrt{3}\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"math","value":"h'=\\frac{v_{yA}^2}{2g}=0.6\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"②"},{"type":"math","value":"h=R(1-\\cos\\theta)+h'=3\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"③\n（2）由功能关系，有"},{"type":"math","value":"mgh+\\frac{1}{2}mv_0^2=\\mu mgx+\\frac{1}{2}kx^2"},{"type":"text","value":"④"},{"type":"math","value":"x_1=1\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"⑤\n（3）第"},{"type":"math","value":"n"},{"type":"text","value":"次压缩弹簧的过程："},{"type":"math","value":"E_n=\\mu mgx_n+\\frac{1}{2}kx_n^2"},{"type":"text","value":"⑥\n弹簧第"},{"type":"math","value":"n"},{"type":"text","value":"次恢复原长的过程："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}kx_n^2=E_{n+1}+\\mu mgx_n"},{"type":"text","value":"⑦\n第"},{"type":"math","value":"n+1"},{"type":"text","value":"次压缩弹簧的过程："},{"type":"math","value":"E_{n+1}=\\mu mgx_{n+1}+\\frac{1}{2}kx_{n+1}^2"},{"type":"text","value":"⑧\n联立可得："},{"type":"math","value":"x_n-x_{n+1}=\\frac{2\\mu mg}{k}=0.28\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"⑨\n第四次压缩弹簧，弹簧的压缩量为"},{"type":"math","value":"x_4=x_1-0.28\\times3=0.16\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"⑩\n由功能关系，有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}kx_4^2-\\frac{1}{2}kx_m^2=\\mu mg(x_4-x_m)"},{"type":"text","value":"⑪"},{"type":"math","value":"x_m=0.12\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"⑫\n解2：第四次回复原长的过程，可以看成简谐运动\n平衡位置"},{"type":"math","value":"x_0=\\frac{\\mu mg}{k}=0.14\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"，\n振幅"},{"type":"math","value":"A=0.02\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"，\n所以最终物块静止在平衡位置左侧0.02 m处，即"},{"type":"math","value":"x_m=0.14-0.02=0.12\\,\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"评分标准：①～⑫式各1分，共12分"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--jingcheng-lianmeng-2512","source_question_id":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"0c56bfbd61f372a0e78df5933ffbba9e02fd1344f05926a55316ad2ae9a243f9","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （13 分）如图所示为某研究团队设计的一种双磁场装置。第二象限内有与 x 轴、y 轴均相切的圆形匀强磁场区域，区域半径为 R，磁感应强度大小为 B。第一、四象限内存在另一匀强磁场，磁感应强度大小未知，两个区域的磁场方向均垂直纸面向里。第四象限内固定一半圆形收集板，半径为 3R，圆心 O'坐标为（0，-3.8R）。第三象限内存在一平行于 x 轴，长 L=2R 的线性发射源，发射源右侧紧靠 y 轴，发射源的任意位置均可沿 y 轴正方向发射相同初速度的电子，当电子击中收集板时会被吸收且使收集板发光。某时刻，发射源所有位置同时发射电子，已知从发射源中点发射的电子恰好垂直 y 轴射入第一象限，此后该粒子能经过坐标为（ "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{2}R"},{"type":"text","value":" ，0）的 P 点。电子质量为 m，电荷量绝对值为 e，不计电子间的相互作用及电子重力，忽略磁场的边缘效应。\n（1）求电子离开发射源时的速度大小v;\n（2）求第一、四象限磁场的磁感应强度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）发射源上坐标为 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{0}=-\\frac{R}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 处的电子经第Ⅱ象限磁场偏转，其出射方向与y轴的夹角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 以及与y轴交点的位置 "},{"type":"math","value":"y_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（4）收集板被电子击中的位置记为 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" （图中未标出）， "},{"type":"math","value":"O'Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向夹角记为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":" ，发现收集板某些区域会发光两次，求该区域对应 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos \\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":" 的范围。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7b3d528c9ece52919af7e1bc0fb784966cb8aa44598b5410dc67ab944c0b0f5a.png","width":477,"height":603,"width_mm":56.092,"row_group":"jingcheng-lianmeng-2512-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 18 题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）\n（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"evB=\\frac{mv^2}{r},\\ r=R"},{"type":"text","value":"①\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{eBR}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"②\n（2）由几何关系可得"},{"type":"math","value":"(R_2-R)^2+2R^2=R_2^2"},{"type":"text","value":"③\n得到"},{"type":"math","value":"R_2=\\frac{3}{2}R"},{"type":"text","value":"④\n根据"},{"type":"math","value":"B_2=\\frac{mv}{eR_2}=\\frac{2}{3}B"},{"type":"text","value":"⑤\n（3）如图："},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f1716726bdcd526af7e6fa77ce3eef34011a40c1a03039cebbf5557aadd6e892.png","width":460,"height":392,"width_mm":58.3},{"type":"math","value":"-\\frac{R}{2}=-(R-R\\cos\\theta)"},{"type":"text","value":"⑥"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"⑦"},{"type":"math","value":"y=R\\sin\\theta+\\left(R-\\sqrt{R^2-\\left(\\frac{R}{2}\\right)^2}\\right)=R"},{"type":"text","value":"（或证明聚焦于"},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":"点，得到"},{"type":"math","value":"y=R"},{"type":"text","value":"）⑧\n（4）发光两次的临界，如图所示\n临界1：轨迹圆与探测圆相切，"},{"type":"math","value":"(1.5R)^2=(4.5R)^2+(4.8R)^2-2\\times4.8R\\times4.5R\\cos\\alpha_1"},{"type":"text","value":"⑨"},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos\\alpha_1=0.95"},{"type":"text","value":"⑩\n临界2：轨迹圆与探测圆相交弦长为直径，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos\\alpha_2=\\frac{2.4R}{3R}=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":"⑪\n故"},{"type":"math","value":"0.8\\leq\\cos\\alpha\\leq0.95"},{"type":"text","value":"⑫"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0a0c9eac3956e2213fab24635c938caf66edca3b39c53876ca46941ad05b223c.png","width":239,"height":334,"width_mm":30.2},{"type":"text","value":"评分标准：①～⑩⑫式各1分，⑪式2分，共13分"}]}}]}
